    "title": "Former Detroit Lions QB Dan Orlovsky emotional on ESPN show",
    "text": "NFLEx-Lion Dan Orlovsky's autistic son inspires TV audience Mark FalknerThe Detroit NewsApril 2, 2026, 8:29 p.m. ETSubscribe to hear this storyMadden Orlovsky's heartfelt performance on national TV had his dad crying on World Autism Awareness Day.The 14-year-old autistic son of former Detroit Lions quarterback Dan Orlovsky had his drawings displayed on ESPN's \"NFL Live\" on Thursday afternoon.Madden, a diehard Eagles fan, sang the team's fight song on the TV set with his father after Philadelphia receiver DeVonta Smith gave Madden a swag bag of Eagles gear.",
